P ilAZBT pf-26_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-28_">The Manufacturer should be contacted for any warranty claim prior to returning products or parts.<br><br>Impact Canopy warrants to the original retail purchaser - with proof of purchase - that our products will&nbsp;be free from defects in material or workmanship for a period of 3 months to 3 years (depending on the product) after the date of original purchase.<br><br>Please check the original packaging and manual for warranty details where applicable.&nbsp; Manuals are also available for download at impactcanopy.com.&nbsp; To submit a warranty request, the customer complete and submit to us the Warranty Claim Form. This form can be obtained by going to impactcanopy.com or by having a Customer Service Representative email or fax the form.&nbsp; Please allow 5-10 business days to process claims.<br><br>Impact Canopy will cover the return shipping cost if the product is damaged upon arrival and reported within three days of arrival (see ITEMS ARRIVED DAMAGE statement below).&nbsp; If the product is damaged during use and is determined to be covered under warranty, the customer is responsible for shipping costs. Parts and labor will be provided for no additional cost.&nbsp;<br><br><b>Another important note regarding color matching:</b>&nbsp; Due to dye lots, ink formulas, and color profiles, the only way to ensure the most consistent colors across all of your products is to order all products at the same time.&nbsp; While we will always do our very best, we cannot guarantee an EXACT color match for products ordered at different times.<br><br><strong>Items arrived damage:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>If you received items damaged during transit, you must report the damage to us within 72 hours of receiving your order.&nbsp; Seven (7) photos of the damaged products and cartons are required.&nbsp; Inspection of the packages and contents may be needed for damage claims.&nbsp; If these requirements are not made, we will not be able to honor the reshipment, replacement or reimbursement of the items.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">If deemed necessary that the product must be shipped back to Impact Canopies for inspection, it is the customer’s responsibility to pay for shipping.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6efc" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-kRRxPL efmMUe pf-29_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-gvZzpm eFakNN"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-30_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dExXmK fNpoDq pf-31_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-32_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-34_">WARRANTY:</span></h2><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-EROOM foKNLL pf-35_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-dNsUpz iDEnkX pf-36_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-38_">1 year limited warranty from the date of purchase for stock, unprinted fabric items including tops, walls, rail skirts, table covers, and rain gutters.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-dNsUpz iDEnkX pf-39_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-41_">6 months limited warranty from the date of purchase for custom printed fabric items - unless otherwise specified - due to fade or a manufacturing defect, IMPORTANT NOTE: Once the artwork is approved, Impact Canopy is not responsible for any issues pertaining to the design.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-dNsUpz iDEnkX pf-42_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-44_">1 year limited warranty from the date of purchase for frames of TL, ALDS, Carnival kits</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-dNsUpz iDEnkX pf-45_ pf-text-1"><span data-